                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJeVR5KY6pQjQREwN2iYFlJn4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwMGRHeGtlR1pYV2xkeVVsaENaWEZOUVVNd1YxRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The braised dishes are basically Sichuan peppercorn flavored. I personally prefer mild spicy, but even the mild version here is quite flavorful.\n\nThe meat seems to have been pan-fried, giving it a slightly charred appearance, which I thought was nice; the radish and beef tendon were also braised until very tender and thoroughly cooked.\n\nAside from the location, I think everything else is excellent and I highly recommend it.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "基本上紅燒也是花椒口味，我個人吃微辣，但這裡微辣還是很夠味喔。\n肉似乎還有煎過，會有微微的焦面，我覺得挺好的；蘿蔔、牛筋也都滷的很軟很透。\n除了地點外，我個人覺得各方面都很好，相當推薦。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
